b0","https://open.spotify.com/episode/30j43hNAzfJKoASNPejdMs","https://pca.st/episode/b0d19a8a-4a22-4a39-8bb3-5a66843fe9ea","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/w2gfjntb"],"related":[]},{"id":"EP-00727","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"年金","date":"2025-05-27T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"","description":"年金は主に老後の生活を支えるための公的な制度です。そのうち基礎年金は、厚生労働省の試算によると、2057年度には2024年度に比べて約3割減るとされています。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":722,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/nenkin","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=bedcfc4e-0285-4be3-8b1d-b2e4007a9554","https://open.spotify.com/episode/3ZGt2g9TxWH3lVu4hOQ3jb","https://pca.st/episode/bb919960-b317-4cc0-b2b8-05cbc2861ec9","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/rqjgwqqh"],"related":[]},{"id":"EP-00728","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"随意契約","date":"2025-05-26T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"","description":"随意契約は競争入札によらず、任意に選んだ相手と結ぶ契約です。会計法などでは原則的に競争相手がなく入札に適さない場合などに例外的に認められます。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":754,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/zuii-keiyaku","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=a4fb4792-bde1-4b4a-ad7c-b2e60044654a","https://open.spotify.com/episode/3tLVdTD9qLq7hsTdbfWgxt","https://pca.st/episode/aaa306dc-bb1c-421d-bb66-b5f31d473ca4","https://listen.style/p/pkvcigu2/xe9o0ev6"],"related":[]},{"id":"EP-00729","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"JOC（日本オリンピック委員会）","date":"2025-05-23T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"","description":"JOC（日本オリンピック委員会）は、トップ選手を強化して五輪に派遣したり、スポーツを通じて平和な社会の実現をめざす「オリンピック・ムーブメント」を広めたりするための団体です。","descriptionSource":"V2-clean","duration":689,"audio":"","audioAvailable":true,"links":["https://omny.fm/shows/asahi/joc","https://www.asahi.com/special/podcasts/item/?itemid=dea8df27-a849-4cb4-9936-b2c600e1ba92","https://open.spotify.com/episode/4fZbiXjWVrrvMjIj7Kwgvh","https://pca.st/episode/dfa6e9d2-3faf-4d34-a77e-4c9cb849b979"],"related":[]},{"id":"EP-00730","show":"ニュースの学校","title":"遺贈寄付","date":"2025-05-22T04:00:00+09:00","cast":"","d